Discrimination
The discrimination can happen in 
various processes such as: recruitment; 
employment tests; screening; 
training etc. The different types of 
discrimination are: direct discrimination; 
indirect discrimination; perceptive 
discrimination; and associative 
discrimination.

The term may 
apply to differences between (1) the 
pay of supervisors and subordinates;

